now-it-all.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent 3 recommended B. We'll say we have concerns about B's weak memory for numbers, which may affect safety-critical tasks, and propose D as a stronger fit.\n\nThus vote for D.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote D.\n\nLet's craft."}
